&lt;li class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It’s the people.&lt;/strong&gt; Our team is our competitive advantage and we are better together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;BENEFITS &amp;amp; PERKS&lt;/span&gt;*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best-in-class healthcare: &lt;/strong&gt;100% company-paid medical, dental, and vision coverage for you and your dependents, with HSA/HRA options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous time off: &lt;/strong&gt;Flexible Time Off (FTO) for exempt employees, accrued PTO of up to 25 days for non-exempt employees, plus 12 paid holidays; Parental Leave; Sick Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuel for your day: &lt;/strong&gt;Daily catered lunch and unlimited snacks for in-office employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And more: &lt;/strong&gt;401(k) retirement plan, fitness reimbursement, and Dog Fridays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity participation: &lt;/strong&gt;Equity is included as part of our total compensation package, giving you an opportunity to share in the company’s success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Do not apply to fixed term and temporary roles&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-pdf_iframe__page&quot; data-page-number=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;As an&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Apprentice Technician&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;, you will support spacecraft production, mechanical &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;assembly, integration, and testing while developing the skills needed to become a well- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;rounded spacecraft technician. This entry-level role is designed for individuals with limited&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;industry experience who are eager to learn through hands-on training, mentorship, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;cross-functional exposure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Mechanical Assembly and Integration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Support the assembly and integration of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;spacecraft structures, components, mechanisms, panels, brackets, fasteners, and flight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;hardware. Assist with the installation and removal of components under the guidance of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;experienced technicians.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Basic Mechanical Operations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Perform fastening, torquing, taping, hardware installation, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;part preparation, and other basic mechanical tasks after appropriate training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span&gt;Test Support:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span&gt;Assist with spacecraft and component test setup and execution, including &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;functional and environmental testing, fixture installation, test equipment setup, and post- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;test activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tools and Documentation:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Learn to safely use hand tools, power tools, torque tools, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;measuring equipment, and production equipment. Read and follow drawings, work &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;instructions, procedures, and manufacturing documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shop and Material Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Support hardware movement, material handling, tool control, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;shop organization, inventory activities, and general production needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Safety and Quality&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Follow FOD, ESD, cleanliness, hardware-handling, personal protective &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;equipment, and shop safety requirements. Document completed work and communicate &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;discrepancies or concerns to technicians, leads, engineers, and management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-Training&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Develop skills across mechanical production, spacecraft integration, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;test. Flex between work areas as production priorities and program needs change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;High school diploma or equivalent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;0–1 year of manufacturing, mechanical, technical, automotive, aerospace, aviation,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;electronics, or similar hands-on experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Basic mechanical aptitude and willingness to learn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Comfort working with hand tools, power tools, and measuring equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Ability to follow detailed written and verbal instructions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Strong attention to detail and commitment to safety and quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Reliable, team-oriented, and willing to take on new responsibilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Ability to work across multiple areas of a production shop.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Ability to lift 25 pounds and work in and around constrained or confined spaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Trade school, technical school, apprenticeship, or relevant technical training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Experience or coursework in manufacturing, mechanical systems, automotive,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;aviation, aerospace, electronics, machining, or a related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Exposure to engineering drawings, work instructions, torque tools, calipers, gauges, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;or other measurement equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Previous experience in manufacturing, production, maintenance, laboratory, or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;technical environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Base Salary:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Apprentice Technician: $24-33/hr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;*this position is non-exempt and is eligible for overtime&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Equity + Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; including Health, Dental, Vision, HRA/HSA options, PTO and paid holidays, 401K, Parental Leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW83253800 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW83253800 BCX0&quot;&gt;Your actual level and base salary will be&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW83253800 BCX0&quot;&gt;determined&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW83253800 BCX0&quot;&gt; on a case-by-case basis and may vary based on the following considerations: job-related knowledge and skills, education, location, and experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW83253800 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location&lt;/strong&gt;—&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;this a fully onsite position based out of our Long Beach, CA office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
