&lt;li&gt;PCB Design Experience (Altium)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test software experience (ex. C++, Python, LabVIEW, Simulink)&lt;br&gt;Mechanical or Electrical CAD Experience (ex. SolidWorks) with tolerance stack ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, design, and testing wire harnesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
