&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;—flexibility to support 24/7 mission operations, including nights, weekends, holidays, and on-call availability during mission-critical events and anomaly response.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
