&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;tooling program&amp;nbsp;schedules and budgets; provide&amp;nbsp;accurate&amp;nbsp;EAC inputs and proactively surface and mitigate cost and schedule risks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
