&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing DISA STIGs and security baselines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of NIST SP 800-53 security controls and how they apply to system administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with space system operations including satellite C2 and ground infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
