&lt;li&gt;Experience with FedRAMP High, CMMC, or DoD IL-5/IL-6 authorizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating security tooling (e.g., SIEMs, vulnerability scanners, audit/logging systems) into development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of zero trust architectures and modern identity solutions applied to classified environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
