&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will be onsite in Denver, CO (preferred) or Long Beach, CA &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
