&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW267002851 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267002851 BCX0&quot;&gt;This position will be open until it is successfully filled. To &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267002851 BCX0&quot;&gt;submit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267002851 BCX0&quot;&gt; your application, please follow the directions below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW267002851 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267002851 BCX0&quot;&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;To conform to U.S. Government space technology export regulations, including the International Traffic in Arms Regulations (ITAR) you must be a U.S. citizen, lawful permanent resident of the U.S., protected individual as defined by 8 U.S.C. 1324b(a)(3), or eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State.&lt;/p&gt;
