&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location&lt;/strong&gt;—Successful candidates will be located near Long Beach, CA. While we observe a hybrid work environment, some work must be done on site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
