&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Familiarity with spacecraft avionics architectures including flight computers, EPS, RF communications, and harness design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
