&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Track record&amp;nbsp;of innovative problem-solving in complex mechanical and thermodynamic design challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in a startup or similarly resource-constrained, high-tempo environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
