&lt;li&gt;Bring your voice to the table in team collaborations on architecture, design, and code reviews &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interact and collaborate with engineers from various disciplines to create emergent results &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
