&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science or similar discipline or relevant experience &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to modern functional programming paradigms, esp. Elixir and/or Erlang&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in developing resilient and fault-tolerant architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to develop leadership ability, exceptional written and oral communication skills, and aptitude for working across disciplines &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys debugging and problem solving live systems &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with distributed systems, reasoning about concurrency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;U.S. Citizen and eligible for DoD Secret or TS/SCI clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
