&lt;li&gt;Relational database experience with PostgreSQL or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with monitoring and tracing in a distributed system &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with real-time applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
