&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-uuid=&quot;f9fd1237-779b-44f5-85d6-7f6343ada15e&quot;&gt;Experience with spacecraft subsystems:
&lt;ul class=&quot;code-line&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot;&gt;Attitude determination and control systems (ADCS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot;&gt;Guidance, navigation, and control (GNC)&lt;/li&gt;
