&lt;li&gt;Requires coordination with contractors, electricians, HVAC technicians, facilities teams, ISSEs, ISSOs, and government partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended periods of standing, bending, kneeling, and working in confined spaces as required for equipment installation and infrastructure buildouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant travel required (up to 50%) to classified facilities, government sites, and partner locations across the United States for facility assessments and infrastructure deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work is performed in Sensitive Compartmented Information Facilities (SCIFs), Special Access Program Facilities (SAPFs), and other classified spaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May require occasional evening or weekend work to coordinate infrastructure deployments during facility maintenance windows&lt;/li&gt;
